              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-item">
              <div class="step-num">3</div>
              <div class="step-body">
                <strong>Each time a student pays, enter the amount in the correct month column</strong>
                <p>For example, if Rahul pays ₹500 for April, type 500 in the April column on his row. The status updates to Paid automatically.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-item">
              <div class="step-num">4</div>
              <div class="step-body">
                <strong>Update attendance in Sheet 2 — P, A, or L for each day</strong>
                <p>You can type lowercase too. Green for present, red for absent, grey for leave — all automatic.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-item">
              <div class="step-num">5</div>
              <div class="step-body">
                <strong>Check the Pending Fees sheet at the start of each month</strong>
                <p>Copy any students with dues, add how many months they owe, and add a reminder note after you contact them.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="callout callout-amber">
            <strong>Habit tip</strong>
            Set a reminder every Sunday evening to update the sheet.
            5 minutes per week means zero panic at month end.
          </div>
